- OpenSpec strict validation passed:
  `/tmp/tl315-openspec-cli/node_modules/.bin/openspec validate fix-arm64-build-duplicate-declarations --strict --no-interactive`.

The checkout had no application `node_modules`; a full Next.js/webpack
compilation was not run. The focused TypeScript binder test proves the two
reported duplicate-binding failures are gone. esbuild bundle checks cover
